WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 13.4 · Strategy to Action: Plan, Deliver & Review
Ownership and capacity

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Every deliverable needs one owner who has agreed it fits their real time.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Name one accountable owner and the contributors.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Estimate effort and elapsed time separately.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Count routine operations before adding new work.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Tide Line: Sari owns safeguarding training, 5 days. With planting days, her 8 days a month are full, so village 2 waits.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create an ownership and capacity check for your plan.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
